        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44120900?u=67b6ccbc99dd8ed3ca8f23b38c5e3f2afcbec890&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Favourite posts, like read posts, will live on the frontend and perish if not carefully guarded.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This -&gt; <a href=\"https://shkspr.mobi/blog/2024/12/whats-the-best-way-to-protect-banking-apps-on-android/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://shkspr.mobi/blog/2024/12/whats-the-best-way-to-protect-banking-apps-on-android/</a> post was so good i need to implement favourite posts to favourite it.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Edit: maybe I can just toot myself.</p>",
